      "location": "School hallway",
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "line_id": "line_1",
          "speaker_id": "c1",
          "text": "Tom, do you love nature? I want to join a club about it.",
          "emotion": "curious",
          "action": "look_at",
          "source_sentence_ids": [
            "s014"
          ]
        },
        {
          "line_id": "line_2",
          "speaker_id": "c2",
          "text": "Yes, I do! There is a nature club. We go hiking every Sunday afternoon.",
          "emotion": "happy",
          "action": "nod",
          "source_sentence_ids": [
            "s016"
          ]
        },
        {
          "line_id": "line_3",
          "speaker_id": "c1",
          "text": "That sounds fun. What do you do there?",
          "emotion": "curious",
          "action": "none",
          "source_sentence_ids": []
        },
        {
          "line_id": "line_4",
          "speaker_id": "c2",
          "text": "We watch birds, take photos, and collect plants and insects.",
          "emotion": "excited",
          "action": "point",
          "source_sentence_ids": [
            "s017"
          ]
        },
        {
          "line_id": "line_5",
          "speaker_id": "c1",
          "text": "Collect? Like a hobby?",
          "emotion": "curious",
          "action": "none",
          "source_sentence_ids": []
        },
        {
          "line_id": "line_6",
          "speaker_id": "c2",
          "text": "Yes, we collect leaves and small things to study them. It's great!",
          "emotion": "happy",
          "action": "nod",
          "source_sentence_ids": [
            "s017"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "scene_2",
      "location": "Nature park",
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "line_id": "line_7",
          "speaker_id": "c1",
          "text": "Wow, this nature park is beautiful! I'm glad I joined the club.",
          "emotion": "excited",
          "action": "walk",
          "source_sentence_ids": [
            "s018"
          ]
        },
        {
          "line_id": "line_8",
          "speaker_id": "c2",
          "text": "Look! A bird over there. Let's take a photo.",
          "emotion": "excited",
          "action": "point",
          "source_sentence_ids": [
            "s017"
          ]
        },
        {
          "line_id": "line_9",
          "speaker_id": "c1",
          "text": "I see it! And look at these flowers. Can we collect some?",
          "emotion": "curious",
          "action": "look_at",
          "source_sentence_ids": [
            "s017"
          ]
        },
        {
          "line_id": "line_10",
          "speaker_id": "c2",
          "text": "Yes, but only a few. We want to discover more wildlife right under our noses!",
          "emotion": "happy",
          "action": "nod",
          "source_sentence_ids": [
            "s019"
          ]
        },
        {
          "line_id": "line_11",
          "speaker_id": "c1",
          "text": "Discover? Like finding new things?",
          "emotion": "curious",
          "action": "none",
          "source_sentence_ids": []
        },
        {
          "line_id": "line_12",
          "speaker_id": "c2",
          "text": "Exactly! Every time we go out, we discover something new. It's amazing.",
          "emotion": "excited",
          "action": "nod",
          "source_sentence_ids": [
            "s019"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "scene_id": "scene_3",
      "location": "School garden",
      "dialogue": [
        {
          "line_id": "line_13",
          "speaker_id": "c1",
          "text": "Tom, I collected these leaves yesterday. Can we look at them in the club?",
          "emotion": "happy",
          "action": "none",
          "source_sentence_ids": [
            "s017"
          ]
        },
        {
          "line_id": "line_14",
          "speaker_id": "c2",
          "text": "Sure! The club meets every Sunday. You can bring your collection.",
          "emotion": "happy",
          "action": "nod",
          "source_sentence_ids": [
            "s016"
          ]
        },
        {
          "line_id": "line_15",
          "speaker_id": "c1",
          "text": "I'm so glad I joined. I discover something new every week!",
          "emotion": "excited",
          "action": "none",
